      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the first frame of the 016 case01 base video. It shows a young adult anime woman with black hair in an updo, soft bangs, gray-violet eyes, a black off-shoulder cropped top, and a slate-gray cargo mini skirt on a sunlit summer park path.\n<Subject 1> is that same woman. Preserve her face, hairstyle, outfit, proportions, and illustrated style from <Picture 1>.\n\nsummary:\n[image-to-video] Continue naturally from <Picture 1>. <Subject 1> makes a small energetic gesture and speaks one short English line in a single continuous shot.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\nPolished 2D anime animation with clean line art, flat cel shading, natural summer daylight, warm sunlight, and neutral color balance. Avoid cyan lighting and any blue color cast. Keep the image bright, fresh, and summery.\n\n[Shot 1]\nStart with the exact composition and appearance of <Picture 1>. <Subject 1> looks directly at the camera, smiles naturally, raises one hand, and makes a small reaching gesture toward the viewer. The camera smoothly pushes in from the initial full-body framing toward an upper-body framing. Her hair tips and clothing move gently in a light summer breeze.\nDuring the motion, she clearly says: <d>[English] Let's create something amazing!</d>\nHer mouth movement should synchronize naturally with the spoken sentence. Preserve her facial identity, hairstyle, body proportions, outfit, and the bright stable park background throughout the shot.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nOnly the natural female voice of <Subject 1>, with faint summer park ambience such as a light breeze and distant birds.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone.",
