      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# TaoMate C3 / セットアップ後に使用\nRun setup.bat first / 最初にsetup.batを実行してください。\nTaoMate 3-step + FC1 W4A4 + sparse 10% + held FFN8/out.\n1024 x 1792 / 124 frames / 24 fps / seed 43.\nModels and the FC1 cache are required; see README.md / README.en.md.\nThe first-frame example is copied to ComfyUI/input/taomate_c3/first_frame.png.\nUse TaoMate_C3.api.json for API benchmarks.\nFor a warm timing run change seed 43 -> 44 to avoid reusing all cached outputs.\nDo not enable --fast fp16_accumulation for the adopted baseline."
      ]
    }
